 [242363]={enName="Who, What, Where, When, and Die! Five Keys to a Good Inquisition",en="Reading this left you with more questions than answers. What was this book even about? And why is it rumbling with great anticipation?",it="Dopo averlo letto, hai più domande che risposte. Di cosa parlava questo libro, poi? E perché brontola con grande trepidazione?"},
