 [271771]={enName="Drained Crystal Fragment",en="A gem that is cool to the touch and hums gently. Strangely no light seems to filter through it.",it="Una gemma fredda al tatto che emette un lieve ronzio. Stranamente, la luce non sembra attraversarla."},
